<title>USA: Flanigan's Enterprises Inc Q2 shr rises.</title>
<headline>Flanigan's Enterprises Inc Q2 shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>FORT LAUDERDALE, Fla. 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>For the 13 wks	    For the 13 wks</p>
<p>				    ended Mar		   ended Mar</p>
<p>				     29, 1997		    30, 1996</p>
<p> TOTAL REVENUES		 5,545,000		   5,594,000</p>
<p> Net profit (loss)		474,000		  386,000(a)</p>
<p>NET INCOME (LOSS) PER COMMON</p>
<p>SHARE</p>
<p>  Primary				 .52			   .39</p>
<p>  Fully Diluted			 .52			   .39</p>
<p>			     For the 26 wks	    For the 26 wks</p>
<p>				    ended Mar		   ended Mar</p>
<p>				    29, 1997		     30, 1996</p>
<p> TOTAL REVENUES		10,555,000		  10,833,000</p>
<p> NET PROFIT		    675,000(b)		  549,000(c)</p>
<p>NET INCOME PER COMMON</p>
<p>SHARE</p>
<p>  Primary				 .73			   .56</p>
<p>  Fully Diluted			 .73			   .56</p>
<p>NOTE - a. Includes $69,000 of gain deferred from the sale of assets and recognized as a result of payment of related notes and $65,000 of allowances for uncollectible notes and mortgages receivable.</p>
<p>b. Includes $50,000 of allowance for uncollectible notes and mortgages.</p>
<p>c. Includes recognition of $101,000 in deferred gain and $105,000 of allowances for uncollectible notes and mortgages receivable.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
